{"version":1,"content":"<p>一種自上世紀60年代便已被發現、卻長期未受到廣泛關注的鈾基材料，近日被科學家發現隱藏着一種此前從未被識別的原子結構。研究人員表示，這項發現不僅挑戰了人們對磁性的傳統理解，還有望為未來高性能電子器件和先進計算機存儲技術的發展提供全新思路。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583294.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:41.936825+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:58:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"622b426f0b72df8a745c296dc0b748907f74171eeb792bc62da0c121da909348","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}